  "title": "GLP-1 RAs Associated With Reduced Progression in Some Cancers",
  "summary": "A propensity-matched analysis of more than 10,000 patients across seven solid tumors found that GLP-1 receptor agonists were associated with reduced metastatic progression, reaching statistical significance in four cancers. The authors call for randomized trials.",
